 od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on ce" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">What I=
s OpenAI Codex CLI in 2026? (Not the 2021 API)</h2><p id=3D"880d" class=3D"=
pw-post-body-paragraph mj mk gz ml b mm oo mo mp mq op ms mt mu oq mw mx my=
 or na nb nc os ne nf ng gs ce" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">If you tuned=
 out =E2=80=9COpenAI Codex=E2=80=9D because you remember the code-completio=
n API that got shut down, you missed a completely different product.</p><p =
