 ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf ng gs ce" data-selectable-paragr=
aph=3D"">The Codex CLI launched on April 16, 2025 and now have ~4 million w=
eekly active users. This was confirmed by Sam Altman on April 8, 2026.</p><=
p id=3D"227d" class=3D"pw-post-body-paragraph mj mk gz ml b mm mn mo mp mq =
mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf ng gs ce" data-selectable-para=
