 mp mq op ms mt mu oq mw mx my or na nb nc os ne nf ng gs ce" data-selectab=
le-paragraph=3D"">Skills support launched for Codex in December 2025. A ski=
ll is a =E2=80=9C<strong class=3D"ml ha">SKILL.md=E2=80=9D</strong> file in=
 =E2=80=9C<strong class=3D"ml ha">~/.agents/skills/=E2=80=9D</strong>.</p><=
p id=3D"288c" class=3D"pw-post-body-paragraph mj mk gz ml b mm mn mo mp mq =
mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf ng gs ce" data-selectable-para=
graph=3D"">Codex loads it automatically when the task matches. You write th=
e instructions once, every future session inherits the behavior. Here are t=
he ten skills you can also install to have a great experience using Codex.<=
/p><h2 id=3D"d564" class=3D"nq nr gz z ns nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od =
oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on ce" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">1. WarpGre=
p. AI Code Search Subagent</h2><p id=3D"6159" class=3D"pw-post-body-paragra=
ph mj mk gz ml b mm oo mo mp mq op ms mt mu oq mw mx my or na nb nc os ne n=
f ng gs ce" data-selectable-paragraph=3D""><strong class=3D"ml ha">The prob=
lem:</strong> Ask Codex to find where a function is used across a large cod=
ebase and it will grep, read adjacent files, load unnecessary context, and =
spend 75 seconds on something that should take 5. The main model context fi=
lls with search noise before reasoning even starts.</p><p id=3D"3658" class=
=3D"pw-post-body-paragraph mj mk gz ml b mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw m=
x my mz na nb nc nd ne nf ng gs ce" data-selectable-paragraph=3D""><strong =
class=3D"ml ha">What it does:</strong> WarpGrep is a reinforcement-learning=
-trained search subagent that runs in an isolated context window. It fires =
8 parallel tool calls per turn: grep, read, list and returns only the file:=
line-range spans the main model needs. Up to 36 tool calls complete in unde=
